    "Authenticate all six exact original commits and actual parents, all40file occurrences/modes, complete original tree populations, before/after bodies and every hunk. The sort support patch also changes core ripple, stepper, table, tabs and tree themes; include those complete changes, not just the selected sort seed. Do not assume a contiguous parent chain or exclude a commit by its M3 title.",
